		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=17216&amp;sid=c326dd8f3b5cb0a93a3b5b6a0f173fc3#17216"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Mar 16, 2004 7:10 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: Sarxas Siaxovog leve the guild today!</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=17216&amp;sid=c326dd8f3b5cb0a93a3b5b6a0f173fc3"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">In the corner is the lonly Dwarf sitting and writing a not, inn seems soo empty and evne dust has gathering in corner, on charis and even on the bardisk <img src="images/smiles/icon_cry.gif" alt="icon_cry.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
The note Sarxas left on the bardisk and slowly walks out from the inn! The note says following:
<br />

<br />
Hi friends and forgive me!
<br />
I have had my greates time in our beloved guild and I will never forget that! I have met friends that have become my deepest treasure and I will never loose that in my heart! I will still strife for that thing we all cheard, the good of Norrath end be an helping hand to others!
<br />

<br />
I must now go further with my life and I will seek my slef a new home but I will probly always return to this place frome time to time. But as things have developed, or shoud I say not developed? I have no chosie if I should find pece in my heart and letting my social needs develop <img src="images/smiles/icon_sad.gif" alt="icon_sad.gif" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
Be brave and fight the battle of the good! Do not hasitate to seek me out for assictance and may Brell be with you all!
<br />

<br />
AXE HIGH<br />_________________<br />/Sarxas Siaxovog -palladin of his 52th season</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
