			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Dear friend Sarxas i am there for you, i will allways help you to fight for the glory of the land to sweep it clean of the evil that strikes upon Norrath.
<br />

<br />
And i have a world of wise i am sure you know what i mean.
<br />
And it is : Then you are falling try to be distracted that will be the clue .
<br />

<br />

<br />
Axe High says
<br />

<br />
Rymer
<br />

<br />
Looks at the moon dreamingly.</span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
